Define function add taking a as i64 and b as i64 returning i64:
    Return a + b.
Define function mul taking a as i64 and b as i64 returning i64:
    Return a * b.
Define global table as array<fn(i64, i64) -> i64, 2>.
Set table[0] to function add.
Set table[1] to function mul.
Return table[0](2, 3) + table[1](4, 5).
